{"date":"2026-08-21","scratchFile":"r09_gate_repair.md","decision":"promoted","form":"prose","ref":"MEMORY.md M-003","reason":"PARTIAL TRIAGE of an in-flight file, revisit at R-09 close. Promoted entry: a read probe must require the production shape, because a dev worktree with a colocated engine derives different values than Cloud Run, which has no sibling engine. That is starvation by environment, the class where code, caller and verdict are all correct and the runtime never supplies the input. It is the same shape as the CI staleness check that returns unverifiable on every run because CI checkouts are shallow. No mechanical guard is available yet, so prose with the mechanism named."}
