{"date": "2026-08-21", "scratchFile": "r09_finish.md", "decision": "promoted", "form": "prose", "ref": "MEMORY.md M-006", "reason": "A canary deployed with image_tag=latest froze whatever digest latest pointed at when the REVISION was created, and the intended image was pushed seven seconds later. cortex-api-00524-pit ran sha256:c88c033, which is neither the serving image nor the merge image; the real one is sha256:fb02222 on 00525-bev. A dry-run against that canary returned cells.changed=0 and read as an overlay no-op when it was actually pre-R-09 compute. Verified by the planner: three distinct digests across the three revisions. Deploy by pinned SHA, never by a floating tag, and confirm the digest on the created revision rather than the tag you asked for."}
